- op: discuss  # dbc6
  at: '2026-10-29T20:49:17Z'  # dbc6
  by: agent  # dbc6
  actor: jgstern_agent  # dbc6
  clock: 7  # dbc6
  nonce: dbc6  # dbc6
  message: "PROGRESS 2026-10-29. Probe matrix on dev cf3e976b92 (one fixture per language; shapes: struct/object field, local binding, module/global binding, array/slice element, call argument; edge = any non-contains/imports edge to the target): python all 5 present (the 06-08 note saying Python struct-field/var-assignment refs are absent is STALE -- dict value, f = fn and self.cb = fn all emit references). Missing: go local binding + slice element; js/ts local binding, module binding, array element; java static field initializer; ruby top-level constant; rust ALL FIVE (incl. call argument); c global initializer; c++ struct field, local, global, array element. GO FIXED in PR #1944 (dev 62212c8cd7): unkeyed composite-literal elements and local bindings (:=, =, function-local var) now emit calls/function_reference via the keyed-field resolver; corpus A/B on 6 Go repos +265/-0, every edge read. Next: js/ts, then java, ruby, rust, c/c++, one PR each."  # dbc6
